{"id":"460308c7099a8386","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-minimal-fixed-point.md","title":"极小固定点","display":"df-minimal-fixed-point — 极小固定点","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","aliases":["91-df-minimal-fixed-point","91-df-Kripke-minimal"],"display":"df-minimal-fixed-point — 极小固定点","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-minimal-fixed-point</span><span>91-df-Kripke-minimal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-minimal-fixed-point — 极小固定点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-minimal-fixed-point-—-极小固定点-$X_{\\min}$\">df-minimal-fixed-point — 极小固定点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}\">\\(X_{\\min}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (跳跃算子, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\)</span> (完整幂集格上的单调算子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\varnothing)\">\\(\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\varnothing)\\)</span> 且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall X(\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\to\\operatorname{ConInfo}(J(X)))\">\\(\\forall X(\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\to\\operatorname{ConInfo}(J(X)))\\)</span>\n(跳跃保持信息一致性)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\quad\n\\eta&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)),\\\\\n\\Gamma_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}&amp;\\coloneqq J(\\Gamma_\\alpha)\n\\quad(\\alpha+1&lt;\\eta),\\\\\n\\Gamma_\\lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\alpha\n\\quad(\\lambda&lt;\\eta\\land\\operatorname{LimOrd}(\\lambda)),\\\\\n\\kappa&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{\\alpha&lt;\\eta:\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=\\Gamma_\\alpha\\},\\\\\nX_{\\min}&amp;\\coloneqq\\Gamma_\\kappa.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\quad\n\\eta&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)),\\\\\n\\Gamma_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}&amp;\\coloneqq J(\\Gamma_\\alpha)\n\\quad(\\alpha+1&lt;\\eta),\\\\\n\\Gamma_\\lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\alpha\n\\quad(\\lambda&lt;\\eta\\land\\operatorname{LimOrd}(\\lambda)),\\\\\n\\kappa&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{\\alpha&lt;\\eta:\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=\\Gamma_\\alpha\\},\\\\\nX_{\\min}&amp;\\coloneqq\\Gamma_\\kappa.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X_{\\min})\n\\land J(X_{\\min})=X_{\\min}\n\\land\n\\forall Y\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(J(Y)=Y\\to X_{\\min}\\subseteq Y\\bigr)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X_{\\min})\n\\land J(X_{\\min})=X_{\\min}\n\\land\n\\forall Y\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(J(Y)=Y\\to X_{\\min}\\subseteq Y\\bigr)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}\">\\(X_{\\min}\\)</span> : 极小固定点（最小真理集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J^n\">\\(J^n\\)</span> : 跳跃算子的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>次迭代</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset\">\\(\\emptyset\\)</span> : 空集（起始真理集）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：极小固定点是Kripke构造中最&quot;谨慎&quot;的真理集，从空集开始，逐步添加句子：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>层级构造</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_0 = \\emptyset\">\\(X_0 = \\emptyset\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_1\">\\(X_1\\)</span>包含基础真句子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_2\">\\(X_2\\)</span>包含关于真句子为真的句子，...</li>\n<li><strong>信息持续性</strong>：一旦某句或其否定的编码进入，就在以后各阶段保留。</li>\n<li><strong>悖论间隙</strong>：标准说谎者及其否定都不进入该一致极小固定点。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>极小固定点的层次：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>第0层</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_0 = \\emptyset\">\\(X_0 = \\emptyset\\)</span>（无句子为真）</li>\n<li><strong>第1层</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_1\">\\(X_1\\)</span>包含所有不含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>的算术真句子</li>\n<li><strong>第2层</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_2\">\\(X_2\\)</span>包含关于第1层句子为真的句子</li>\n<li><strong>第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>层</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_n = J(X_{n-1})\">\\(X_n = J(X_{n-1})\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>极限层</strong>：在最先稳定的超穷阶段取得固定点；一般不能把它预先截断为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}X_n\">\\(\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}X_n\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\">\\(\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\\)</span> 是集合序数上界。\n若在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 之前始终严格增长，各阶段会给出从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 到\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 的单射，与 Hartogs 性质矛盾；故定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 的集合非空。</p>\n<p>与极大固定点的对比：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>极小固定点：从空集开始向上构造</li>\n<li>极大固定点：从全集开始向下构造</li>\n</ul>\n<p>极小固定点给出 KF 的一个预期标准模型，但裸 KF 的一阶公理并不把所有\n模型唯一限定为这个固定点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-minimal-fixed-point-—-极小固定点-$X_{\\min}$","text":"df-minimal-fixed-point — 极小固定点 $X_{\\min}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J$ (跳跃算子, see [[91-df-jump-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall X(\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X)\\to\\operatorname{ConInfo}(J(X)))","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\quad\n\\eta&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)),\\\\\n\\Gamma_0&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}&\\coloneqq J(\\Gamma_\\alpha)\n\\quad(\\alpha+1<\\eta),\\\\\n\\Gamma_\\lambda&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha<\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\alpha\n\\quad(\\lambda<\\eta\\land\\operatorname{LimOrd}(\\lambda)),\\\\\n\\kappa&\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{\\alpha<\\eta:\\Gamma_{\\alpha+1}=\\Gamma_\\alpha\\},\\\\\nX_{\\min}&\\coloneqq\\Gamma_\\kappa.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X_{\\min})\n\\land J(X_{\\min})=X_{\\min}\n\\land\n\\forall Y\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(J(Y)=Y\\to X_{\\min}\\subseteq Y\\bigr)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"X_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"J^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"X_0 = \\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"X_1","display":false},{"tex":"X_2","display":false},{"tex":"X_0 = \\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"X_1","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"X_2","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"X_n = J(X_{n-1})","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup_{n<\\omega}X_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":2940,"backlinks":[{"id":"832d8d672c5cd995","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e382a4415fd419dc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1791b62b90bdbbfd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"10229cf1ace7edd3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X_{\\min}$ (极小固定点的真句编码集, see [[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]])"},{"id":"2bc4d1a14a37aabf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":[